# Nimú architecture (agent memory)

Full detail: [`ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../ARCHITECTURE.md). Read it before changing data loading, Apps Script, or cache.

## What this is

Static vanilla storefront: `index.html` + `styles.css` + shared `js/*`. Dashboard: `dashboard.html`. No framework, no build. Catalog = static JSON in `data/`. Google Sheets = source of truth. Apps Script source lives in `resources/` (manual sync to GAS editor).

Needs HTTP server locally (`python3 -m http.server 8000`).

## Pipeline

```
Sheets → publishCatalog() ~1h → GitHub data/*.json → fetch() → UI (+ localStorage 24h)
Sheets → doGet search → APPS_SCRIPT_URL (CacheService 5min)
Cart → WhatsApp + form POST ORDERS_URL
       → findOrCreateClientCode_ (contacts SF/BA) → orders sheet (+ CodCliente)
Dashboard → GET ORDERS_URL?action=clients|orders
         → remito POST (+ clientCode) → WhatsApp to client
Dashboard slider → form POST ORDERS_URL (sliderData) → GitHub imgs/slider + data/{place}/slider.json
```

## Endpoints (`js/config.js`)

- `DATA_BASE = 'data'`
- `APPS_SCRIPT_URL` — search (`?action=search`)
- `ORDERS_URL` — order POST + dashboard GET (`clients`/`orders`/`slider`) + slider write (`sliderData`)

Do **not** use catalog `appscript.js` `doPost` for orders; frontend uses `ORDERS_URL` only. Slider read/write also uses `ORDERS_URL`.

## Shared JS

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `js/config.js` | STORE, URLs, zones, `fmt` |
| `js/catalog.js` | categories/products/slider fetch, cache, code index |
| `js/orders-api.js` | `postOrderToSheet`, `fetchOrdersApi` |
| `js/slider-api.js` | `postSliderToSheet`, image compress |
| `js/slider.js` | storefront place carousel |
| `js/whatsapp.js` | customer→store + remito→client builders |
| `js/dashboard.js` | back office UI (clients, remito, slider) |

## Cache

| Layer | Where | TTL | Keys |
|-------|-------|-----|------|
| Client | `localStorage` | 24h | `categories_v2__{place}`, `products_v2__{place}__{category}` |
| Server | `CacheService` | 300s | `categories_v1_*`, `products_v1_*`, `search_v1_*` |
| Orders read | `CacheService` | ~90s | `clients_v1_*`, `orders_v1_*` |
| Static | GitHub `data/` | ~15min publish | places / categories / products JSON |

- `clearCache()` / `clearCatalogCache()` clears catalog LS keys. Search is not client-cached.
- Stale UI after publish: wait 24h, call `clearCache()`, or bump key version.

## Scripts (`resources/`)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `appscript.js` | Catalog API `doGet` + server cache; legacy `doPost` |
| `appscript-publish.js` | `publishCatalog()` → GitHub; binary commit/delete helpers |
| `appscript-pedidos.js` | Orders writer + `doGet` clients/orders/slider; slider GitHub write |

Places: `santafe`, `buenosaires` (sheet IDs in `appscript.js` `PLACES`).

Contacts sheet `1Pyd9Bll_…`: tabs `DB CONTACTS SF` (`S#`) / `DB CONTACTS BA` (`B#`). Match phone then name; else create next code with DNI in col F (solo altas; E CUIL vacío). Orders get `CodCliente` after Fecha and never store DNI. If `customer.clientCode` is set (dashboard remito), reuse it. Redeploy GAS after editing `resources/appscript-pedidos.js`.

## Do not

- Trust README for `PRODUCTS_URL` / PWA / “open without server” (outdated).
- Expect full `data/{place}/` or `imgs/` in every local clone (generated remotely).
- Wire both order `doPost` paths without intent.
